msgstr "https://github.com/clifgriffin/simple-ldap-login"

#: Simple-LDAP-Login.php
#. Description of the plugin
msgid "Connect WordPress accounts to Active Directory or OpenLDAP."
msgstr "Forbind WordPress-konti til Active Directory eller OpenLDAP."

#: Simple-LDAP-Login.php
#. Author of the plugin
msgid "Clif Griffin Development Inc."
msgstr "Clif Griffin Development Inc."

#: Simple-LDAP-Login.php
#. Author URI of the plugin
msgid "https://clifgriffin.com"
msgstr "https://clifgriffin.com"

#: pro/src/Accounts.php:205
msgid "Your directory account is suspended. Contact your site administrator."
msgstr "Din mappekonto er suspenderet. Kontakt webstedets administrator."

#: pro/src/Accounts.php:249
msgid "The directory identity has changed. Contact your site administrator."
msgstr "Identiteten i mappen er ændret. Kontakt webstedets administrator."

#: pro/src/Admin.php:49
msgid "User data"
msgstr "Brugerdata"

#: pro/src/Admin.php:50
#: pro/src/Admin.php:84
msgid "Single sign-on"
msgstr "Single sign-on"

#: pro/src/Admin.php:59
msgid "Accounts"
msgstr "Konti"

#: pro/src/Admin.php:60
msgid "Audit"
msgstr "Revisionslog"

#: pro/src/Admin.php:70
msgid "Profile updates"
msgstr "Profilopdateringer"

#: pro/src/Admin.php:70
msgid ""
"Copy standard LDAP profile fields to existing WordPress accounts at login. "
"Recovery accounts and super administrators are excluded."
msgstr ""
"Kopiér LDAP-standardprofilfelter til eksisterende WordPress-konti ved "
"login. Gendannelseskonti og superadministratorer er undtaget."

#: pro/src/Admin.php:71
msgid "Update profiles at login"
msgstr "Opdatér profiler ved login"

#: pro/src/Admin.php:71
msgid ""
"Replace names, email, and website with directory values. Empty directory "
"values clear the field. A missing or invalid email stops the update."
msgstr ""
"Erstat navne, e-mail og websted med værdier fra mappen. Tomme mappeværdier "
"rydder feltet. En manglende eller ugyldig e-mail stopper opdateringen."

#: pro/src/Admin.php:60
msgid "Custom user fields"
msgstr "Brugerdefinerede felter"

#: pro/src/Admin.php:60
msgid ""
"Copy LDAP fields, such as phone number or department, to WordPress at "
"login. Your theme or other plugins can use these values."
msgstr ""
"Kopier LDAP-felter, såsom telefonnummer eller afdeling, til WordPress ved "
"login. Dit tema eller andre plugins kan bruge disse værdier."

#: pro/src/Admin.php:61
#: src/Settings.php:615
msgid "Field mappings"
msgstr "Feltkortlægninger"

#: pro/src/Admin.php:62
#. translators: 1: Example field mapping, 2: Text type identifier, 3: Number type identifier.
#, php-format
msgid ""
"One mapping per line: LDAP attribute:WordPress meta key:type. Example: "
"%1$s. Types: %2$s or %3$s."
msgstr ""
"Én mapping pr. linje: LDAP-attribut:WordPress meta nøgle:type. Eksempel: "
"%1$s. Typer: %2$s eller %3$s."

#: pro/src/Admin.php:85
msgid "Group roles"
msgstr "Grupperoller"

#: pro/src/Admin.php:85
msgid ""
"Set the WordPress role from LDAP groups at each login. The first matching "
"rule applies. If no rule matches, use the default role. Recovery accounts "
"and super administrators are excluded."
msgstr ""
"Angiv WordPress-rollen ud fra LDAP-grupper ved hvert login. Den første "
"matchende regel gælder. Hvis ingen regel matcher, bruges standardrollen. "
"Gendannelseskonti og superadministratorer er undtaget."

#: pro/src/Admin.php:86
msgid "Group-to-role rules"
msgstr "Regler fra gruppe til rolle"

#: pro/src/Admin.php:86
msgid ""
"One group:role rule per line. Example: Editors:editor. Leave blank to keep "
"current roles."
msgstr ""
"Én regel i formatet group:role pr. linje. Eksempel: Editors:editor. Lad "
"feltet være tomt for at beholde de nuværende roller."

#: pro/src/Admin.php:108
msgid ""
"Enterprise includes scheduled account import, scheduled access removal, and "
"multisite membership rules. Your saved settings are kept."
msgstr ""
"Enterprise omfatter planlagt import af konti, planlagt fjernelse af adgang "
"og regler for medlemskab på multisite. Dine gemte indstillinger bevares."

#: pro/src/Admin.php:108
#: pro/src/Audit.php:224
msgid "View Enterprise upgrade"
msgstr "Se opgradering til Enterprise"

#: pro/src/Admin.php:113
msgid "Enterprise account settings"
msgstr "Kontoindstillinger for Enterprise"

#: pro/src/Admin.php:97
msgid "Multisite membership"
msgstr "Multisite-medlemskab"

#: pro/src/Admin.php:97
msgid ""
"Assign site membership and roles from directory groups. The first matching "
"rule for each site applies. These rules replace the group role rules for "
"network activation."
msgstr ""
"Tildel webstedsmedlemskab og roller ud fra mappegrupper. Den første "
"matchende regel for hvert websted gælder. Disse regler erstatter "
"grupperollereglerne ved netværksaktivering."

#: pro/src/Admin.php:98
msgid "Group-to-site rules"
msgstr "Regler fra gruppe til websted"

#: pro/src/Admin.php:98
msgid ""
"One group:site ID:role rule per line. Example: Editors:2:editor. On group "
"removal, restore prior membership or remove a membership created by these "
"rules. Manual role changes are kept on removal. Leave blank to stop "
"membership updates."
msgstr ""
"Én regel i formatet group:site ID:role pr. linje. Eksempel: "
"Editors:2:editor. Når gruppemedlemskabet ophører, gendannes det tidligere "
"medlemskab, eller et medlemskab oprettet af disse regler fjernes. Manuelle "
"rolleændringer bevares ved fjernelsen. Lad feltet være tomt for at stoppe "
"medlemskabsopdateringer."

#: pro/src/Admin.php:101
msgid "Scheduled account import"
msgstr "Planlagt kontoimport"

#: pro/src/Admin.php:101
msgid ""
"Import directory accounts once per hour through WordPress scheduled tasks. "
"Set a search account on Connection. Site traffic or a system task must run "
"WordPress cron."
msgstr ""
"Importér mappekonti én gang i timen via planlagte WordPress-opgaver. Angiv "
"en søgekonto under Forbindelse. Besøg på webstedet eller en systemopgave "
"skal køre WordPress-cron."

#: pro/src/Admin.php:102
msgid "Enable scheduled import"
msgstr "Aktivér planlagt import"

#: pro/src/Admin.php:102
msgid ""
"Create accounts without a first login. Existing local accounts are "
"excluded. No user session is created."
msgstr ""
"Opret konti uden et første login. Eksisterende lokale konti er undtaget. "
"Der oprettes ingen brugersession."

#: pro/src/Admin.php:103
msgid "Import Base DN"
msgstr "Basis-DN for import"

#: pro/src/Admin.php:103
msgid "Leave blank to use the connection Base DN."
msgstr "Lad feltet være tomt for at bruge forbindelsens basis-DN."

#: pro/src/Admin.php:104
msgid "Import groups"
msgstr "Importgrupper"

#: pro/src/Admin.php:104
msgid ""
"One group per line. Import users in at least one group. Leave blank to "
"import all users below the Import Base DN. Login group restrictions also "
"apply."
msgstr ""
"Én gruppe pr. linje. Importér brugere i mindst én af grupperne. Lad feltet "
"være tomt for at importere alle brugere under basis-DN for import. "
"Gruppebegrænsninger for login gælder også."

#: pro/src/Admin.php:106
msgid "Scheduled access removal"
msgstr "Planlagt fjernelse af adgang"

#: pro/src/Admin.php:106
msgid ""
"Check managed directory accounts once per hour. A confirmed missing "
"account, disabled AD account, changed directory identity, or failed login "
"group rule suspends access and ends all WordPress sessions. Connection "
"errors keep the current access state."
msgstr ""
"Kontrollér administrerede mappekonti én gang i timen. En bekræftet "
"manglende konto, en deaktiveret AD-konto, en ændret mappeidentitet eller en "
"login-grupperegel, der ikke er opfyldt, suspenderer adgangen og afslutter "
"alle WordPress-sessioner. Forbindelsesfejl bevarer den nuværende "
"adgangstilstand."

#: pro/src/Admin.php:107
msgid "Enable scheduled access removal"
msgstr "Aktivér planlagt fjernelse af adgang"

#: pro/src/Admin.php:107
msgid ""
"Keep user data and content. Restore access after a later successful "
"directory check. Recovery accounts and super administrators are excluded. "
"Existing suspensions remain if the task or license stops."
msgstr ""
"Behold brugerdata og indhold. Gendan adgang efter en senere vellykket "
"mappekontrol. Gendannelseskonti og superadministratorer er undtaget. "
"Eksisterende suspenderinger bevares, hvis opgaven stopper, eller licensen "
"bliver inaktiv."

#: pro/src/Admin.php:71
msgid "Custom field storage"
msgstr "Lagring af brugerdefinerede felter"

#: pro/src/Admin.php:71
msgid "Leave the defaults unless your integration uses different user meta keys."
msgstr ""
"Lad standardindstillingerne være, medmindre din integration bruger "
"forskellige bruger meta nøgler."

#: pro/src/Admin.php:72
#: src/Settings.php:616
msgid "LDAP value suffix"
msgstr "LDAP værdi suffix"

#: pro/src/Admin.php:72
msgid "Stores the LDAP value, such as phone_ldap."
msgstr "Lagrer LDAP-værdien, såsom phone_ldap."

#: pro/src/Admin.php:73
#: src/Settings.php:617
msgid "WordPress value suffix"
msgstr "WordPress værdi suffix"

#: pro/src/Admin.php:73
msgid "Stores the editable WordPress value, such as phone_wp."
msgstr "Lagrer den redigerbare WordPress-værdi, såsom phone_wp."

#: pro/src/Admin.php:83
msgid "Single sign-on (SSO)"
msgstr "Single sign-on (SSO)"

#: pro/src/Admin.php:84
msgid "Sign users in to WordPress after your web server authenticates them."
msgstr "Log brugere ind på WordPress, efter at din webserver har godkendt dem."

#: pro/src/Admin.php:85
msgid "Enable single sign-on"
msgstr "Aktivér enkeltlogon"

#: pro/src/Admin.php:85
msgid "Users do not need a second login for WordPress."
msgstr "Brugere har ikke brug for en anden login til WordPress."

#: pro/src/Admin.php:87
msgid ""
"Configure your web server to authenticate users and set REMOTE_USER. Enter "
"an LDAP search account on Connection."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurer din webserver til at godkende brugere og indstille REMOTE_USER. "
"Indtast en LDAP-søgekonto under Forbindelse."

#: pro/src/Admin.php:88
msgid ""
"Do not copy browser headers into REMOTE_USER. Block access that bypasses "
"web server authentication."
msgstr ""
"Kopier ikke browseroverskrifter ind i REMOTE_USER. Bloker adgang, der omgår "
"webservergodkendelse."

#: pro/src/Admin.php:87
msgid "Web server authentication"
msgstr "Webserverautentificering"

#: pro/src/Admin.php:88
msgid "REMOTE_USER is present."
msgstr "REMOTE_USER er til stede."

#: pro/src/Admin.php:88
msgid "REMOTE_USER is missing. Check the web server configuration."
msgstr "REMOTE_USER mangler. Tjek webserverkonfigurationen."

#: pro/src/Audit.php:224
msgid ""
"An Enterprise license is required to collect, read, or export audit "
"history. Existing records are kept."
msgstr ""
"En Enterprise-licens er nødvendig for at indsamle, læse eller eksportere "
"revisionshistorik. Eksisterende poster bevares."

#: pro/src/Audit.php:229
msgid "Enterprise audit settings"
msgstr "Revisionsindstillinger for Enterprise"

#: pro/src/Audit.php:211
msgid "Audit history"
msgstr "Revisionshistorik"

#: pro/src/Audit.php:211
msgid ""
"Record login results and account changes. Records contain event names and "
"account IDs. Passwords, directory field values, and credentials are "
"excluded."
msgstr ""
"Registrér loginresultater og kontoændringer. Poster indeholder "
"hændelsesnavne og konto-id’er. Adgangskoder, mappefeltværdier og "
"legitimationsoplysninger er undtaget."

#: pro/src/Audit.php:212
msgid "Enable audit history"
msgstr "Aktivér revisionshistorik"

#: pro/src/Audit.php:212
msgid ""
"Store private WordPress records. Collection is off by default. Existing "
"records remain when collection stops."
msgstr ""
"Gem private WordPress-poster. Indsamling er som standard deaktiveret. "
"Eksisterende poster bevares, når indsamlingen stopper."

#: pro/src/Audit.php:213
msgid "Retention (days)"
msgstr "Opbevaring (dage)"

#: pro/src/Audit.php:213
msgid ""
"Default: 30. Range: 1 to 3650. A daily task removes older records while "
"collection is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Standard: 30. Interval: 1 til 3650. En daglig opgave fjerner ældre poster, "
"mens indsamling er aktiveret."

#: pro/src/Audit.php:229
msgid "Export CSV"
msgstr "Eksportér CSV"

#: pro/src/Audit.php:230
msgid ""
"Latest 50 records. The export includes all retained records in this scope. "
"Times use UTC."
msgstr ""
"Seneste 50 poster. Eksporten omfatter alle gemte poster i dette område. "
"Tidspunkter er i UTC."

#: pro/src/Audit.php:231
msgid "Time (UTC)"
msgstr "Tid (UTC)"

#: pro/src/Audit.php:231
msgid "Event"
msgstr "Hændelse"

#: pro/src/Audit.php:231
msgid "Actor ID"
msgstr "Aktør-id"

#: pro/src/Audit.php:231
msgid "User ID"
msgstr "Bruger-id"

#: pro/src/Audit.php:231
msgid "Site ID"
msgstr "Websteds-id"

#: pro/src/Audit.php:253
msgid "You do not have permission to export these records."
msgstr "Du har ikke tilladelse til at eksportere disse poster."

#: pro/src/Settings_Rules.php:53
msgid ""
"Activate an Enterprise license to change these settings. Your saved "
"settings are kept."
msgstr ""
"Aktivér en Enterprise-licens for at ændre disse indstillinger. Dine gemte "
"indstillinger bevares."

#: pro/src/Settings_Rules.php:130
msgid "A Pro setting is not valid. Check the format and role names."
msgstr "En Pro-indstilling er ugyldig. Kontrollér formatet og rollenavnene."

#: pro/src/Upgrade_Guard.php:84
msgid ""
"The update was stopped. Activate Simple LDAP Login Pro to restore LDAP "
"login."
msgstr ""
"Opdateringen blev stoppet. Aktiver Simple LDAP Login Pro for at gendanne "
"LDAP-login."

#: pro/src/Upgrade_Guard.php:86
msgid ""
"Update blocked: This package does not include all Pro files. To install "
"Free, deactivate the plugin first. Your installed files and settings are "
"unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Opdatering blokeret: Denne pakke inkluderer ikke alle Pro-filer. For at "
"installere Free, deaktiver plugin'et først. Dine installerede filer og "
"indstillinger er uændrede."

#: pro/src/Upgrade_Guard.php:113
msgid "WordPress could not reactivate the plugin."
msgstr "WordPress kunne ikke genaktivere plugin."

#: Simple-LDAP-Login.php:29
msgid "Simple LDAP Login needs PHP 8.1 or later."
msgstr "Simple LDAP Login kræver PHP 8.1 eller nyere."

#: Simple-LDAP-Login.php:39
msgid "Plugin files are missing. Reinstall Simple LDAP Login from the release ZIP."
msgstr "Plugin-filer mangler. Geninstaller Simple LDAP Login fra release ZIP."

#: src/Admin.php:90
msgid "You do not have permission to change these settings."
msgstr "Du har ikke tilladelse til at ændre disse indstillinger."

#: src/Admin.php:97
msgid "The settings scope has changed. Open the settings page and try again."
msgstr "Indstillingsomfanget er ændret. Åbn indstillingssiden og prøv igen."

#: src/Admin.php:141
msgid "You do not have permission to view these settings."
msgstr "Du har ikke tilladelse til at se disse indstillinger."

#: src/Admin.php:153
msgid "Network settings"
msgstr "Netværksindstillinger"

#: src/Admin.php:153
msgid "Site settings"
msgstr "Siteindstillinger"

#: src/Admin.php:154
#: src/Admin.php:177
msgid "LDAP login settings"
msgstr "LDAP-loginindstillinger"

#: src/Admin.php:155
msgid "Connect to LDAP, then test a login before enabling authentication."
msgstr ""
"Forbind til LDAP, og test derefter et login, før du aktiverer "
"autentificering."

#: src/Admin.php:160
msgid "LDAP login and SSO are disabled by SLL_DISABLE_LDAP in wp-config.php."
msgstr "LDAP-login og SSO er deaktiveret af SLL_DISABLE_LDAP i wp-config.php."

#: src/Admin.php:164
msgid ""
"Your saved settings use backup LDAP servers, SSO, or custom user fields. "
"Install Simple LDAP Login Pro to use these features. Your settings are kept."
msgstr ""
"Dine gemte indstillinger bruger LDAP-reserveservere, SSO eller "
"brugerdefinerede brugerfelter. Installer Simple LDAP Login Pro for at bruge "
"disse funktioner. Dine indstillinger bevares."

#: src/Admin.php:169
msgid ""
"The saved LDAP search password cannot be read. Enter it again on the "
"Connection tab."
msgstr ""
"Den gemte LDAP-søgeadgangskode kan ikke læses. Indtast den igen på fanen "
"Forbindelse."

#: src/Admin.php:172
msgid "PHP LDAP is missing. Ask your host to install it before enabling LDAP login."
msgstr ""
"PHP LDAP mangler. Bed din host om at installere det, før LDAP-login "
"aktiveres."

#: src/Admin.php:175
msgid ""
"LDAP passwords are sent without encryption. Use StartTLS or LDAPS if your "
"server supports it."
msgstr ""
"LDAP-adgangskoder sendes uden kryptering. Brug StartTLS eller LDAPS, hvis "
"din server understøtter det."

#: src/Admin.php:207
msgid "Save settings"
msgstr "Gem indstillinger"

#: src/Admin.php:208
msgid "Settings on other tabs are kept."
msgstr "Indstillinger på andre faner bevares."

#: src/Admin.php:215
msgid ""
"Save settings before you check the connection. The check uses saved "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"Gem indstillingerne, før du tjekker forbindelsen. Tjekket bruger de gemte "
"indstillinger."

#: src/Admin.php:219
#: src/Admin.php:391
#: src/Admin.php:393
msgid "Check Connection"
msgstr "Tjek forbindelse"

#: src/Admin.php:221
msgid "Open the Testing tab for login tests and more information."
msgstr "Åbn fanen Test for at teste login og få flere oplysninger."

#: src/Admin.php:223
msgid "LDAP connection"
msgstr "LDAP-forbindelse"

#: src/Admin.php:224
msgid "LDAP login"
msgstr "LDAP-login"

#: src/Admin.php:224
msgid "Enable LDAP authentication."
msgstr "Aktiver LDAP-godkendelse."

#: src/Admin.php:227
#: src/Settings.php:597
msgid "Directory type"
msgstr "Katalogtype"

#: src/Admin.php:229
msgid "Active Directory"
msgstr "Active Directory"

#: src/Admin.php:230
msgid "OpenLDAP / other LDAP directory"
msgstr "OpenLDAP / andet LDAP-katalog"

#: src/Admin.php:233
#: src/Settings.php:599
msgid "LDAP servers"
msgstr "LDAP-servere"

#: src/Admin.php:242
msgid ""
"One hostname or IP address per line. An active Pro or Enterprise license "
"enables backup servers. Without an active license, only the first server is "
"used."
msgstr ""
"Et værtsnavn eller en IP-adresse pr. linje. En aktiv Pro- eller "
"Enterprise-licens giver adgang til reserveservere. Uden en aktiv licens "
"bruges kun den første server."

#: src/Admin.php:234
#: src/Settings.php:600
msgid "Base DN"
msgstr "Base DN"

#: src/Admin.php:234
msgid "Where to search for users. Example: DC=example,DC=org."
msgstr "Hvor der skal søges efter brugere. Eksempel: DC=example,DC=org."

#: src/Admin.php:235
#: src/Settings.php:601
msgid "Username suffix"
msgstr "Brugernavnssuffix"

#: src/Admin.php:235
msgid "Added to usernames without a domain. Example: @example.org."
msgstr "Tilføjet til brugernavne uden domæne. Eksempel: @example.org."

#: src/Admin.php:236
#: src/Settings.php:602
msgid "Windows domain"
msgstr "Windows-domæne"

#: src/Admin.php:236
msgid "Short domain name, such as EXAMPLE. Takes priority over the username suffix."
msgstr "Kort domænenavn, såsom EXAMPLE. Har prioritet over brugernavnssuffixet."

#: src/Admin.php:238
#: src/Admin.php:241
#: src/Settings.php:598
msgid "Connection security"
msgstr "Forbindelsessikkerhed"

#: src/Admin.php:238
msgid "TLS requires a trusted server certificate."
msgstr "TLS kræver et betroet servercertifikat."

#: src/Admin.php:243
msgid "StartTLS (recommended)"
msgstr "StartTLS (anbefales)"

#: src/Admin.php:244
msgid "LDAPS"
msgstr "LDAPS"

#: src/Admin.php:245
msgid "Unencrypted LDAP"
msgstr "Udkrypteret LDAP"

#: src/Admin.php:247
msgid "Unencrypted LDAP requires permission on the Advanced tab."
msgstr "Udkrypteret LDAP kræver tilladelse på fanen Avanceret."

#: src/Admin.php:249
#: src/Settings.php:603
msgid "Port"
msgstr "Port"

#: src/Admin.php:249
msgid "389 for StartTLS; 636 for LDAPS."
msgstr "389 for StartTLS; 636 for LDAPS."

#: src/Admin.php:250
msgid "Search subfolders"
msgstr "Søg i undermapper"

#: src/Admin.php:250
msgid "Search all organizational units below the Base DN."
msgstr "Søg i alle organisatoriske enheder under Base DN."

#: src/Admin.php:252
msgid "LDAP search account"
msgstr "LDAP-søgekonto"

#: src/Admin.php:252
msgid "An LDAP account with read access to users and groups."
msgstr "En LDAP-konto med læseadgang til brugere og grupper."

#: src/Admin.php:253
msgid "Search account"
msgstr "Søgekonto"

#: src/Admin.php:253
msgid "LDAP bind DN or account name."
msgstr "LDAP bind DN eller kontonavn."

#: src/Admin.php:254
#: src/Settings.php:614
msgid "Search account password"
msgstr "Adgangskode til søgekonto"

#: src/Admin.php:254
msgid "Leave blank to keep the saved password."
msgstr "Lad være blank for at bevare den gemte adgangskode."

#: src/Admin.php:262
msgid "Login rules"
msgstr "Loginregler"

#: src/Admin.php:263
msgid "Require LDAP passwords"
msgstr "Krav om LDAP-adgangskoder"

#: src/Admin.php:263
msgid "Block WordPress passwords except for recovery access."
msgstr "Bloker WordPress-adgangskoder undtagen for recovery-adgang."

#: src/Admin.php:266
#: src/Settings.php:612
msgid "Local recovery access"
msgstr "Lokal recovery-adgang"

#: src/Admin.php:268
msgid "Selected administrators"
msgstr "Valgte administratorer"

#: src/Admin.php:269
msgid "All super administrators (legacy)"
msgstr "Alle superadministratorer (legacy)"

#: src/Admin.php:269
msgid "All administrators (legacy)"
msgstr "Alle administratorer (legacy)"

#: src/Admin.php:270
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Slukket"

#: src/Admin.php:272
msgid "Choose who can use a WordPress password when LDAP passwords are required."
msgstr ""
"Vælg, hvem der kan bruge en WordPress-adgangskode, når LDAP-adgangskoder "
"kræves."

#: src/Admin.php:275
msgid "Automatic account creation"
msgstr "Automatisk kontooprettelse"

#: src/Admin.php:275
msgid "Create a WordPress account on the first successful LDAP login."
msgstr "Opret en WordPress-konto ved den første succesfulde LDAP-login."

#: src/Admin.php:280
#: src/Settings.php:611
msgid "Default role"
msgstr "Standardrolle"

#: src/Admin.php:280
msgid "For new accounts only."
msgstr "Kun for nye konti."

#: src/Admin.php:281
#: src/Settings.php:609
msgid "Required groups"
msgstr "Nødvendige grupper"

#: src/Admin.php:281
msgid ""
"One group name per line. Users must belong to at least one. Leave blank to "
"allow all LDAP users."
msgstr ""
"Én gruppenavn pr. linje. Brugere skal tilhøre mindst én. Lad være blank for "
"at tillade alle LDAP-brugere."

